                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large open vehicle, drawn by horses, used to carry loads of hay; a haywagon."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2c00f4a0-1d62-4667-8292-c1949697288a",
                                                "sense_id": "bb58cd56-1c3b-358b-bbfb-b5bdea33f0b4",
                                                "text": "By the 1870s in England, toy dappled-grey horses were much in favour, some pulled bright yellow carts with tip-up backs, some pulled coal-trucks, others pulled haywains and dust-carts, all of these being a convenient size for a child to pull along on a string."
